          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár waawuti'iimarí bar alhhe'eesaywós gwa eér, nee tlakweemaaín naa bu'uutiyé' alhhe'eesay ngwa ayé', waawutmoó wák oo fuqurángw koóm oo /uuruú koóm ni hardah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós i ló'wa aleesleemuú kón, nee muruú yaariír gu ló'wa hhitín, umuú gaaro ar i tleehhamór wa slai ga aleesláy. Múk yaariír oo iia tleér nee múk hhohhó' oo Mungú gu hhaamiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inós tawa fuqurusmo baraá muruú tlakwe i ló'wa waaraahh nee tiri xirfayees. Múk yaariír gu naaqo tsuu/ nee sleeme inós nee geeraharusmoó geeraharuuse ti tlaampa'aasiyá', ala inós ku suqúy nee Mungú tam dákw hee gur gadiyusiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iigu'utudú ilahhooár tsiindo nee matlaatle tinda kuúngií oó' oo ló'. Hamí ala maweek baraá naaqórí ale, asma hardahamuuwós ku baloó tseeweeká oo iwa boo/i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
